    "description": {
      "value": "The opaque crystal lenses of these sleek goggles do not obscure vision, but rather enhance it. While wearing the goggles, you gain a +1 item bonus to Perception checks involving sight.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nRotating the lenses 90 degrees, you gain darkvision for 1 hour.\n\nThe item bonus is +2, and the darkvision lasts until you rotate the lenses back or the item is no longer invested by you, whichever comes first."
